WEBVTT

00:33.355 --> 00:43.104
The water runs, the towel is warm Washing off the

00:43.204 --> 00:48.969
lingering storm The heavy scent of diesel fumes

00:49.409 --> 00:54.314
Replaced by soap in quiet rooms

00:59.520 --> 01:07.346
Lift your arms, a gentle sound My feet are

01:08.768 --> 01:14.872
hovering off the ground The wet and cold are

01:14.973 --> 01:20.317
peeled away To face the light of this new day In

01:20.337 --> 01:26.262
the airside sanctuary

01:29.137 --> 01:35.340
The world is soft and light No more shadows, no

01:35.380 --> 01:41.042
more scary Fragments of the night

01:45.163 --> 01:48.825
I'm clean, I'm dry, I'm safe, I'm here Watching

01:48.845 --> 01:52.827
the grey clouds disappear inside Safe

02:02.896 --> 02:10.538
The door is locked, but I'm not trapped The map of

02:10.658 --> 02:20.264
hell has been remapped You turn to me, you meet my

02:20.824 --> 02:30.670
eyes No anger there, no heavy sighs Do you mind,

02:31.450 --> 02:42.204
you softly ask Removing one more heavy mask You

02:42.244 --> 02:47.969
give me space You give me choice You give me back

02:48.069 --> 02:49.851
my stolen voice

02:58.378 --> 03:02.062
In the airside sanctuary

03:05.024 --> 03:11.188
The world is soft and light No more shadows, no

03:11.228 --> 03:15.411
more scary Fragments of the night

03:21.035 --> 03:24.737
I'm clean, I'm dry, I'm safe, I'm here Watching

03:24.837 --> 03:35.901
the grey clouds disappear inside Safe inside

03:46.983 --> 03:54.324
Ticket in my pocket Gateway on the wing Boarding

03:54.384 --> 04:01.838
group A The finest thing A miracle of time and

04:01.938 --> 04:07.023
chance A victory in a single glance The busiest

04:07.384 --> 04:13.611
day of all the years But somehow

04:16.994 --> 04:18.816
We are sitting here

04:23.763 --> 04:32.024
Turn my chair to face the glass Watch the heavy

04:33.325 --> 04:40.726
shadows pass The engines roar, the birds take

04:40.926 --> 04:47.327
flight Into the morning light

04:49.768 --> 04:51.648
Just hold me

04:56.176 --> 04:58.043
Just hold me

